      "question": "Select the option that is related to the figure (C) in the same way as figure (B) is related to figure (A).",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the option that is related to the figure (C) in the same way as figure (B) is related to figure (A).</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt.18-7-22_D44.png\" style=\"width: 382px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt.18-7-22_D45.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" />"
