        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt.18-7-22_D47.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt.18-7-22_D48.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">In figure A and B:</p>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n\t<li style=\"\">Letter interchange its position in clockwise direction.</li>\n\t<li style=\"\">Middle figure rotate in clockwise direction.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt.18-7-22_D49.png\" style=\"width: 177px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Similarly,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">In figure C and D:</p>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n\t<li>Letter interchange its position in clockwise direction.</li>\n\t<li>Middle figure rotate in clockwise direction.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt.18-7-22_D50.png\" style=\"width: 184px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;Option 3&quot;&nbsp;</span>is the correct answer.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt.18-7-22_D44.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F1_Savita_State%20Govt.18-7-22_D45.png",
