      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Figure 1 to figure 2</span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li>figure rotates in an anticlockwise direction.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">​<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F1_Savita_State%20G_27-7-23_Satya_D21.png\" style=\"width: 187px; height: 144px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Similarly,</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Figure 3&nbsp;to figure 4</span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li>figure rotates in an anticlockwise direction.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F1_Savita_State%20G_27-7-23_Satya_D22.png\" style=\"width: 184px; height: 139px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&#39;Option (4)&#39;&nbsp;</span>is&nbsp;the correct answer.</p>\n",
