      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">The center shape (triangle + circle) is interchanging its position.&nbsp;</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">left and right image flipped&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">horizontally&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">their positions.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F3_Vinanti_State%20Govt._20.12.22_D2_V2.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Similarly,&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li>The center shape <span style=\"\">(square + triangle)</span>&nbsp;is interchanging its position.&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>left and right image flipped&nbsp;horizontally&nbsp;their positions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Madhuri_State%20Govt._20.12.2022_D8.png\" style=\"width: 179px; height: 80px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the pair is&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Madhuri_State%20Govt._20.12.2022_D9.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is &quot;<strong>Option (2)</strong>&quot;.<span style=\" \"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n",
